cff-version: 1.2.0
message: If you use this code, cite godot-sandbox.
title: godot-sandbox guest API and cmake helper (vendored)
abstract: >-
  The C++ guest API (program/cpp/docker/api) and the add_sandbox_program cmake
  helper (program/cpp/cmake) from the org's godot-sandbox fork, unmodified
  except that the cmake example directory is omitted. This is everything a
  guest ELF needs to build against; the runtime addon is separate
  (project/addons/godot_sandbox).
type: software
authors:
  - name: libriscv contributors
    website: https://github.com/libriscv/godot-sandbox
  - name: V-Sekai-fire
repository-code: https://github.com/V-Sekai-fire/godot-sandbox
